# Rust
target/
# Cargo.lock IS tracked for binaries (reproducible builds required for kernel)

# Editor
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Build artifacts
build/
*.elf
*.bin
*.hex
*.o
*.d

# ESP32 / Embedded
flasher.py
esp-idf/

# Espressif's radio blobs, fetched by `make blobs` rather than vendored.
# Apache-2.0 binaries from Espressif's own repositories, pinned to the
# revisions esp-idf references -- see doc/plan-radio.md for why these are
# fetched rather than committed.
.blobs/

# Developer-local secrets, sourced by the build recipes (see LOAD_ENV in the
# Makefile). Holds the Wi-Fi credentials `wificonnect` compiles in --
# FLINT_WIFI_SSID / FLINT_WIFI_PASS -- so it must never be committed.
.env

# Local Wrangler state (cache + account info) from `npx wrangler` — the site
# deploys from CI, so this never belongs in the repo.
.wrangler/
